OL,4,BKlopp advice and Iraola confidence     
OL,5,Bboosts Wirtz                           
OL,6,GFlorian Wirtz says he is enjoying his  
OL,7,Gbest form yet at Liverpool and         
OL,8,Gbenefiting from Andoni Iraola's        
OL,9,Gconfidence and Jurgen Klopp's advice.  
OL,11,FWirtz, 23, scored in Liverpool's 4-0   
OL,12,Fwin over Manchester United on Sunday   
OL,13,Fand has three goals and six assists    
OL,14,Fthis season.                           
OL,16,FThe Germany midfielder made the #116m  
OL,17,Fmove from Bayer Leverkusen in the      
OL,18,Fsummer of 2025 and after failing to    
OL,19,Fmake his mark in his first campaign in 
OL,20,FEngland, is beginning to showcase his  
OL,21,Fquality for Iraola's side.             
